### Mockery API Requests - Local Environment
@host = localhost:8080

### ===========================================
### Get Mock
### ===========================================
### Retrieves mock response(s) based on X-Mockery-Mock header
GET http://{{host}}/api/mock
X-Mockery-Mock: mockery/success, mockery/success-2, mockery/401

### ===========================================
### Get Mocks (List)
### ===========================================
### Lists all available mocks
GET http://{{host}}/api/mocks

### ===========================================
### Create Mock
### ===========================================
### Creates a new mock file
POST http://{{host}}/api/mocks
Content-Type: application/json
X-Mockery-Mock: test/success.json

{
    "name": "foo"
}

### ===========================================
### Delete Mock
### ===========================================
### Deletes an existing mock file
DELETE http://{{host}}/api/mocks
Content-Type: application/json
X-Mockery-Mock: test/success.json

{
    "name": "foo"
}
